gs": {"disabled": false}, "type": "VHS_VideoCombine", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [285.3127746582031, 522.3439331054688], "pos": [6294.740234375, -792.143310546875], "id": 152, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-videohelpersuite", "ver": "4d907bee61e92c2e65af3bd6383a4e4d356126d1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"save_output": true, "filename_prefix": true, "loop_count": true, "format": true, "frame_rate": true, "pingpong": true}, "Node name for S&R": "VHS_VideoCombine"}, "order": 24}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [1817.759521484375, 131.35025024414062], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [4463.892578125, -1560.2432861328125], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 110, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#fac400", "borderRadius": 39, "textAlign": "center", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 74, "backgroundAlpha": 1, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "B站账号：叨叨2066——新手友好度爆棚工作流拆解", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#ffffff"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [265.9106140136719, 211.21409606933594], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [4523.15576171875, -381.687744140625], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 196, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#AD2EFC", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 10, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "【初步图像缩放 ImageScaleBy】\n作用：在 VOSR 2.0 前调整图像尺寸，不是主要超分节点。\n\n• 图像：接收 VHS_LoadVideo 的视频帧。\n• 缩放算法：当前 lanczos。细节保留较好，通常保持；bilinear 更快，bicubic 可作替代。\n• 缩放比例：由 easy float 提供，当前约 1.0。\n  1.0 = 保持原尺寸；0.5 = 宽高减半；2.0 = 宽高加倍。\n\n建议：尺寸合适时用 1.0；显存不足可试 0.5；不建议这里先大幅放大再叠加 VOSR 和 DLLS5。节点保存的 0.5 是本地值，实际运行以外部 easy float 连接值为准。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#FCFCFC"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [278.075927734375, 417.8362121582031], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [5936.47412109375, -289.7893981933594], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 200, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#AD2EFC", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 10, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "【DLLS5 细节增强 RH_DLSS5Enhance】\n作用：接收 VOSR 放大后的图像，执行 DLLS5 的清晰度、纹理、降噪、色彩和时序增强，再输出图像。\n\n输入：image 已连接；video 当前未连接，本工作流采用图像帧处理。\n\n当前主要设置：\n• 放大模式：1.724x (Balanced)，在清晰度、速度和稳定性间折中。\n• 风格/细节模式：natural，倾向自然纹理，适合真实视频和普通动画。\n• 数值参数：0、1、1、1.2、1.5，用于内部增强、细节、锐化或融合强度，建议小幅调整。\n• 强度：0.24，可围绕 0.15～0.35 测试，过高可能画面发硬。\n• 时序模式：temporal sequence，有助于减少相邻帧闪烁。\n• 其他 on/auto：功能开关和自动策略，首次使用保持默认。\n\n遇到过锐、光晕、噪点放大或闪烁时，一次只改一个参数进行对比。由于 JSON 未保存每个控件的可读标签，数值与具体标签以节点界面实际显示为最终依据。\n\n输出：images → 最终 VHS_VideoCombine；video/status 当前未使用。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#FCFCFC"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [248.91969299316406, 241.5729522705078], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [4528.92578125, -111.14234161376953], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 203, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#AD2EFC", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 10, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "【初始缩放比例 easy float】\n作用：为 ImageScaleBy 的 scale_by 提供缩放比例。\n\n当前值：约 1.0\n• 1.0：保持输入帧原始宽高。\n• 0.5：宽高减半，可降低后续 VOSR 显存压力。\n• 2.0：宽高加倍，会明显增加像素数量、显存和处理时间。\n\n建议：素材尺寸合适时保持 1.0；显存不足或视频过大时可试 0.5；不建议先设置 2.0 再叠加 VOSR 2 倍或 4 倍。修改此节点即可控制 ImageScaleBy，不需要直接改 ImageScaleBy 内部值。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#FCFCFC"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [259.85369873046875, 290.2046203613281], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [5594.00390625, -166.13671875], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 201, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#AD2EFC", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 10, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "【中间视频合成 VHS_VideoCombine】\n作用：把 VOSR2Upscale 图像帧合成为中间视频，并接入原视频音频。\n\n• 图像：接收 VOSR2Upscale 输出。\n• 音频：接收 VHS_LoadVideo 音频。\n• 帧率：24。通常与输入视频一致，可用 24/25/30。\n• 循环次数：0。0 表示不额外循环。\n• 文件名前缀：AnimateDiff。可改成 VOSR2_intermediate 便于区分。\n• 格式：video/h264-mp4；像素格式 yuv420p，兼容性好。\n• CRF：19。数值越低质量越高、文件越大；常用 18～23。\n• save_metadata：开启，便于追溯工作流参数。\n• trim_to_audio：关闭。音画长度不一致时再开启。\n• Ping-Pong：关闭。需要正放加倒放时才开启。\n• 保存到输出文件夹：开启。只想看最终结果时可关闭中间输出。\n• no_preview：关闭。关闭时可在界面查看预览。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#FCFCFC"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "bgcolor": "#f7f7f7", "size": [210, 130], "color": "#ffffff", "pos": [3709.809814453125, -959.6796264648438], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 205, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "int", "links": [347], "label": "整数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "int"}], "color": "#ffffff", "widgets_values": [2], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "easy int", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fafafa", "size": [270, 58], "pos": [4879.5595703125, -703.384521484375], "id": 163, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy int"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [342], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "frame_count", "label": "帧计数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "frame_count"}, {"name": "audio", "links": [321, 334], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"name": "video_inf