"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "VHS_LoadVideo", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [324.6943054199219, 520.6600952148438], "pos": [3985.84326171875, -906.0643310546875], "id": 150, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-videohelpersuite", "ver": "4d907bee61e92c2e65af3bd6383a4e4d356126d1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"custom_height": true, "force_rate": true, "custom_width": true, "select_every_nth": true, "frame_load_cap": true, "format": true, "video": true, "skip_first_frames": true}, "Node name for S&R": "VHS_LoadVideo"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [394.5279846191406, 249.88670349121094], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [3955.6376953125, -106.96812438964844], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 195, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#AD2EFC", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 10, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "【视频导入 VHS_LoadVideo】\n作用：读取视频并拆分为图像帧，同时提取帧数、音频和视频信息。\n\n• 视频：选择要处理的视频文件，建议使用 MP4/MOV；测试时先用短片段。\n• 强制帧率：当前 24。保持原帧率，或统一为 24/30；帧率越高，处理量越大。\n• 尺寸模式：当前 Disabled。通常保持关闭，避免导入阶段重复缩放。\n• 自定义宽度/高度：当前 0。仅在自定义尺寸模式下填写，例如 1280×720、1920×1080。\n• 帧数读取上限：当前 0。0 为完整读取；测试可填 48/72/120。\n• 跳过前 X 帧：当前 0。按帧跳过开头内容，24 FPS 下 240 帧约等于 10 秒。\n• 间隔：当前 1。逐帧读取；提高到 2 以上会减轻负载但降低时间连续性。\n• 格式：当前 AnimateDiff。通常保持默认。\n\n输出：IMAGE → ImageScaleBy；AUDIO → 视频合成；另有帧数和视频信息输出。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#FCFCFC"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [287.30047607421875, 292.9710388183594], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [6296.69482421875, -156.3604278564453], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 202, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#AD2EFC", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 10, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "【最终视频输出 VHS_VideoCombine】\n作用：将 DLLS5Enhance 输出的最终图像帧合成为视频，接入原音频并保存最终结果。\n\n• 图像：接收 RH_DLSS5Enhance 的增强图像。\n• 音频：接收 VHS_LoadVideo 的原音频。\n• 帧率：24。应与输入或强制帧率保持一致。\n• 循环次数：0。不额外循环。\n• 文件名前缀：AnimateDiff。建议改为 VOSR2_DLLS5_final。\n• 格式：video/h264-mp4，适合大多数播放器和剪辑软件。\n• 像素格式：yuv420p，发布时建议保持。\n• CRF：19。常用 18～23；19 属于画质较好的设置。\n• save_metadata：开启，需要复盘或分享时建议保留。\n• trim_to_audio：关闭，音画不一致时可尝试开启。\n• Ping-Pong：关闭，普通视频保持关闭。\n• 保存到输出文件夹：开启，正式输出必须开启。\n• no_preview：关闭，可直接查看最终视频。\n\n输出：Filenames 为最终生成的视频文件名。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#FCFCFC"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "float", "links": [344], "label": "浮点", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "float"}], "color": "#ffffff", "widgets_values": [0.5000000000000001], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "easy float", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#fafafa", "size": [270, 58], "pos": [4520.29833984375, -699.2120971679688], "id": 169, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy float"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [220.93214416503906, 234.71884155273438], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [4892.08056640625, -113.9981460571289], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 199, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#AD2EFC", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 10, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "【VOSR 放大倍率 easy int】\n作用：为 VOSR2Upscale 提供 upscale 参数。\n\n当前值：2\n• 2：推荐常用值，画质、速度、显存较平衡。\n• 4：适合低分辨率素材，但耗时和显存明显增加。\n\n建议：优先调这里控制 VOSR 倍率。不要与 DLLS5 同时设为高倍率，否则可能过度锐化、边缘发光或产生伪影。此节点属于用户直接操作的参数节点。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#FCFCFC"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [274.755126953125, 380.5716552734375], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [5253.67431640625, -257.7756652832031], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 198, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#AD2EFC", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 10, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "【VOSR 2.0 超分 VOSR2Upscale】\n作用：使用 VOSR 2.0 对视频帧进行主要超分，是本流程核心节点。\n\n• model：接收 VOSR2ModelLoader 的模型。\n• image：接收 ImageScaleBy 的图像帧。\n• upscale：由 easy int 提供，当前 2。2 倍最平衡；4 倍更清晰但更耗显存且更容易出现伪影。\n• seed：当前 42。固定种子便于复现；更换种子可比较不同细节结果。\n• color_alignment：当前 fixed。保持较稳定的颜色关系，减少前后色彩漂移。\n• tile_size：工作流值显示为 wavelet。该值与 JSON 输入类型标记不完全一致，最终以 ComfyUI 界面标签为准，不擅自改写。\n• tile_overlap：工作流值 512。分块重叠越大，接缝越不明显，但显存和耗时增加。\n• vae_tile_size：工作流值 32。显存不足时降低，显存充足可逐步增加。\n• vae_tile_overlap：工作流值 1024。出现块边缘或亮度不一致可增加；显存不足可降低。\n\n建议：常规视频先用 2 倍；出现接缝时调 overlap；显存不足时优先降低分块尺寸或减少帧数。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#FCFCFC"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [280.46636962890625, 200.10147094726562], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [4877.876953125, -382.14166259765625], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 197, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#AD2EFC", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 10, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "【VOSR 2.0 模型加载 VOSR2ModelLoader】\n作用：加载 VOSR 2.0 超分模型并传给 VOSR2Upscale。\n\n• model：当前 VOSR2。选择 VOSR 模型名称，通常保持当前值。\n• dtype：当前 default。使用插件默认推理数据类型，兼容性和稳定性较好。\n\n建议：新手保持 default；只有确认显卡支持并需要优化显存或速度时，才尝试其他 dtype 选项。\n\n输出：VOSR2_MODEL → VOSR2Upscale 的 model。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#FCFCFC"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "Filenames", "label": "文件名", "type": "VHS_FILENAMES", "localized_name": "Filenames"}], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": {"save_output": true, "filename_prefix": "AnimateDiff", "loop_count": 0, "pix_fmt": "yuv420p", "save_metadata": true, "crf": 19, "trim_to_audio": false, "videopreview": {"paused": false, "hidden": false, "params": {"storageProvider": "cos", "cos_url": "https://rh-images.xiaoyaoyou.com//c54ea81267fc634cbbe6c4754454bd1d/output/AnimateDiff_00001_p81-audio_dapos_1788936342.mp4", "workflow": "AnimateDiff_00001_p81.png", "format": "video/h264-mp4", "subfolder": "", "label": "Normal", "type": "output", "frame_rate": 24, "bucket": "rh-images-1252422369", "score": 24, "filename": "AnimateDiff_00001_p81-audio_dapos_1788936342.mp4", "fullpath": "/data/ComfyUI/personal/c54ea81267fc634cbbe6c4754454bd1d/output/AnimateDiff_00001_p81-audio.mp4", "objectKey": "c54ea81267fc634cbbe6c4754454bd1d/output/AnimateDiff_00001_p81-audio_dapos_1788936342.mp4"}}, "format": "video/h264-mp4", "no_preview": false, "frame_rate": 24, "pingpong": false}, "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 333, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio", "link": 334, "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "meta_batch", "label": "批次管理", "type": "VHS_BatchManager", "localized_name": "meta_batch"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"widget": {"name": "frame_rate"}, "name": "frame_rate", "label": "帧率", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "帧率"}, {"widget": {"name": "loop_count"}, "name": "loop_count", "label": "循环次数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "循环次数"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "文件名前缀", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "格式", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "格式"}, {"widget": {"name": "pingpong"}, "name": "pingpong", "label": "Ping-Pong", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "Ping-Pong"}, {"widget": {"name": "save_output"}, "name": "save_output", "label": "保存到输出文件夹", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "保存到输出文件夹"}, {"widget": {"name": "no_preview"}, "shape": 7, "name": "no_preview", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "no_preview"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "VHS_VideoCombine", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [247.84393310546875, 501.111572265625], "pos": [5585.69873046875, -872.7484741210938], "id": 161, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-videohelpersuite", "ver": "4d907bee61e92c2e65af3bd6383a4e4d356126d1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"save_output": true, "filename_prefix": true, "loop_count": true, "format": true, "frame_rate": true, "pingpong": true}, "Node name for S&R": "VHS_VideoCombine"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [832.0116577148438, 1224.7276611328125], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [6708.87890625, -1010.7854614257812], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 206, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#AD2EFC", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 10, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "### 1. upscaling_mode 放大倍率模式\n可选：`DLAA(1x)` / `Quality(1.5x)` / `Balanced(1.724x)` / `Performance(2x)`GitHub\n- DLAA：**不放大尺寸，只做降噪和画质增强**，适合原图尺寸修复，不改变分辨率- Quality：1.5 倍放大，画质优先，速度慢- Balanced：1.724 倍，**平衡画质与速度（你当前选的）**，最常用- Performance：2 倍放大，速度更快，细节损失略大✅ 调整建议：- AI 短视频、人物画面：Balanced (1.724x)- 原图只去噪不放大：DLAA (1x)- 低分辨率素材想要拉到 4K：Performance (2x)\n\n### 2. style 风格\n可选：`default` / `natural` / `cinematic`- default：默认，通用性最强，人像、场景都适配- natural：自然模式，抑制 AI 过度锐化，减少塑料感，适合实拍人像- cinematic：电影感，对比度轻微拉高，氛围感强，适合短片、风景，容易轻微改变肤色✅ 调整建议：人像优先 natural；影视短片选 cinematic；AI 生成视频默认 default。\n\n### 3. preset NR 预设（0/1/2/3）\nDLSS5 神经渲染内置预设，0=Default，1/2/3 是不同强度的降噪 + 细节重建方案- preset 0：基础默认，改动最小，**最不容易翻车，推荐起步**- preset1：增强降噪，适合噪点多的 AI 视频- preset2：强细节重建，适合模糊老素材，更容易出现画面畸变- preset3：实验性，改动幅度最大，闪烁风险最高，谨慎使用✅ 调整建议：新手固定 0；噪点严重再试 1；不推荐直接上 2、3。\n\n### 4. intensity 总强度（0~2.0）\n整体 NR 神经渲染的作用强度，控制 AI 修改画面的力度\n- 0：完全关闭增强，原图输出- 1.0：默认值，平衡修复程度- > > 1：更强降噪 + 补细节，但容易扭曲五官、画面变形、产生伪影\n- <1：保守修复，保留原图质感，风险最低✅ 调整建议：AI 视频建议`0.7~1.0`；实拍素材`0.6~0.8`；**不要超过 1.2**，越高越容易人脸崩坏。\n\n### 5. tone 局部光影强度（0~2.0）\n控制局部明暗、对比度，提亮暗部、压高光，提升画面通透感\n- 低数值：保留原始光影，不改动画面明暗- 高数值：增强 HDR 感，暗部细节拉满，但容易出现光影断层、色偏✅ 调整建议：默认 1.0；人像降到 0.7~0.9，防止人脸明暗奇怪；暗场景素材可以 1.0~1.2。\n### 6. structure 结构强度（0~2.0）\n控制边缘、物体轮廓、纹理结构重建，是影响画面清晰度的核心参数- 越高：线条、物体边缘更锐利，纹理更多；但过高会出现锯齿、塑料质感、帧闪烁- 越低：结构柔和，保留原图模糊质感✅ 调整建议：**人像建议 1.0~1.2（你当前 1.2 刚好上限）**；风景 / 场景 1.2~1.4；AI 抖动视频建议降到 0.9，减少闪烁。\n### 7. skin 皮肤优化强度（0~2.0）\n专门针对人脸皮肤的优化，磨皮 + 保留皮肤质感\n- 越高：皮肤越平滑，去除噪点；过高会丢失毛孔，脸像蜡像- 越低：皮肤保留原始质感，噪点保留✅ 调整建议：人物视频`1.2~1.5`（当前 1.5 是上限）；无人物场景直接降到 0.5 或关闭；动漫人脸不要开太高，容易糊脸。\n### 8. auto_mask 自动蒙版 on/off\n自动识别画面区域，**只对需要修复的区域做增强，保护背景 / 人物不被全局修改**，减少画面崩坏\n- on：开启自动蒙版，推荐一直开；AI 视频、人像非常有用- off：整张画面统一增强，适合纯风景无主体画面✅ 调整建议：绝大多数场景保持`on`；只有纯色背景、简单图形素材才关闭。\n### 9. motion 运动处理 auto /on/off\n**视频时序核心参数，控制帧间运动补偿，抑制画面闪烁**\n- auto：自动检测运动，推荐默认，静态画面弱处理，动态画面开启时序稳定- on：强制时序帧稳定，大幅度减少 AI 视频闪烁，但会增加渲染耗时，运动剧烈画面容易拖影- off：关闭时序，单帧独立处理，图片处理用；视频不要 off，极易闪屏✅ 调整建议：视频一律`auto`；严重闪烁的 AI 视频改成`on`；单张图片增强选 off。\n### 10. scene_change_threshold 场景切换阈值（0~1）\n检测镜头切换，当画面变化超过阈值，会重置时序缓存，防止跨镜头错误拖影\n- 数值越小：越容易判定为镜头切换，重置帧缓存- 数值越大：认为镜头连续，持续时序处理，镜头切换处容易出现残留拖影✅ 调整建议：短视频多镜头`0.2~0.25`（当前 0.24 合适）；长镜头固定场景`0.3~0.4`。\n### 11. batch_mode 批处理模式\n- `temporal sequence`：时序序列模式，**视频必选！读取前后帧信息，抑制闪烁**- single image：单图模式，只处理单张图片，帧之间无关联，图片增强使用\n✅ 调整建议：做视频保持`temporal sequence`；图片放大切换 single image。\n### 12. warmup_frames 预热帧数\n时序处理的前置缓存帧数。渲染开始前先缓存 N 帧，稳定开头画面。✅ 调整建议：一般`0`即可；视频开头几帧闪烁，改成 2~4。\n### 13. keep_audio 保留音频 on/off\n视频输入时保留原视频音频流；图片序列模式无效。✅ 视频工作流打开 on；图片序列无所谓。\n### 14. backend 计算后端 auto\n自动选择显卡计算管线；一般不动。auto：自动识别显卡（40/50 系）；显卡异常报错时，可以手动切换。\n### 15. channel_order 色彩通道 auto\n色彩通道顺序，RGB/BGR 自动适配；**不要手动修改，容易颜色反转**。\n### 16. hdr HDR 模式 on/off\nHDR 色彩空间处理开关\n- on：支持 HDR 素材，扩展动态范围；SDR 素材开启会轻微拉高对比度- off：标准 SDR 处理。✅ 调整建议：素材是 HDR 片源打开 on；普通 SDR AI 生成视频，关闭 hdr，防止色彩异常。\n### 17. global_tone 全局色调（0~2.0）\n全局画面调色，整体明暗偏移。0 = 不改动全局亮度。✅ 调整建议：**保持 0.00（你当前）**，尽量不要动；需要调色交给后面调色节点，这里改动容易帧间颜色跳动。\n### 18. detail 细节增强（0~2.0）\n微观细节，发丝、纹理、细小颗粒增强✅ 调整建议：默认 1.0；人像 0.8~1.0，防止噪点被放大；建筑风景 1.0~1.2。\n### 19. color 色彩增强（0~2.0）\n色彩饱和度、色彩还原增强✅ 调整建议：默认 1.0；AI 视频色彩已经很艳，降到 0.8~0.9 防止色彩溢出；灰片老素材可以 1.1。\n### 20. runtime_dir / wine_prefix\n运行时目录，Linux/Wine 环境用，Windows 用户留空，不用填。\n\n# 两套推荐参数预设（直接套用）\n## ✅ 预设 A：AI 生成人物短视频（你的场景最推荐，减少人脸崩坏 + 防闪烁）\n| upscaling_mode | Balanced(1.724x) |\n| style | natural || preset | 0 || intensity | 0.85 || tone | 0.80 || structure | 0.8 || skin | -1 || auto_mask | off || motion | auto || scene_change_threshold | 0.24 || batch_mode | temporal sequence || warmup_frames | 0 || keep_audio | on || hdr | off || global_tone | -1 || detail | 0.8 || color | 0.35 |\n\n## ✅ 预设 B：实拍风景 / 产品视频，无大量人脸\n| upscaling_mode | Balanced(1.724x) || style | default || preset | 0 || intensity | 1.0 || tone | 1.0 || structure | 1.3 || skin | 0.5 || auto_mask | on || motion | auto || scene_change_threshold | 0.24 || batch_mode | temporal sequence || hdr | off || global_tone | 0.00 || detail | 1.1 || color | 1.0 |\n\n## ✅ 预设 C：只降噪，不放大尺寸（DLAA）\nupscaling_mode 改为`DLAA(1x)`，其余用预设 A，适合已经 4K 素材，只去噪修复。\n# ⚠️ 调参避坑指南\n1. **优先小幅度微调**：intensity、structure、skin 这三个是翻车重灾区，每次 ±0.05 测试，不要一次性拉满。\n2. **视频闪烁怎么解决**：降低`structure`、`intensity`；motion 改为`on`；确认 batch_mode 是`temporal sequence`。\n3. **人脸蜡像 / 磨太重**：降低 skin 参数，降低 intensity，style 切换为 natural。\n4. **颜色忽亮忽暗**：global_tone 保持 0，hdr 关闭，color 不要大于 1.0。\n5. **渲染很慢**：把 upscaling_mode 改成 Performance (2x) 会更快，但画质下降；或者降低分辨率输入。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#FCFCFC"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "images", "links": [346], "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"name": "status", "label": "status", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "status"}], "color": "#57ed8c", "widgets_values": ["1.5x (Quality)", "default", 0, 0.8500000000000002, 0.8000000000000002, 0.8000000000000002, -1, "on", "auto", 0.24, "temporal sequence", 0, "on", "auto", "auto", "on", -1, 0.8000000000000002, 0.3500000000000001, "", ""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 345, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscaling_mode"}, "shape": 7, "name": "upscaling_mode", "label": "upscaling_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "upscaling_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "style"}, "shape": 7, "name": "style", "label": "style", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "style"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset"}, "shape": 7, "name": "preset", "label": "preset", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "preset"}, {"widget": {"name": "intensity"}, "shape": 7, "name": "intensity", "label": "intensity", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "intensity"}, {"widget": {"name": "tone"}, "shape": 7, "name": "tone", "label": "tone", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "tone"}, {"widget": {"name": "structure"}, "shape": 7, "name": "structure", "label": "structure", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "structure"}, {"widget": {"name": "skin"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skin", "label": "skin", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "skin"}, {"widget": {"name": "auto_mask"}, "shape": 7, "name": "auto_mask", "label": "auto_mask", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "auto_mask"}, {"widget": {"name": "motion"}, "shape": 7, "name": "motion", "label": "motion", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "motion"}, {"widget": {"name": "scene_change_threshold"}, "shape": 7, "name": "scene_change_threshold", "label": "scene_change_threshold", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "scene_change_threshold"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_mode"}, "shape": 7, "name": "batch_mode", "label": "batch_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "batch_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "warmup_frames"}, "shape": 7, "name": "warmup_frames", "label": "warmup_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "warmup_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_audio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "keep_audio", "label": "keep_audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "keep_audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "backend"}, "shape": 7, "name": "backend", "label": "backend", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "backend"}, {"widget": {"name": "channel_order"}, "shape": 7, "name": "channel_order", "label": "channel_order", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "channel_order"}, {"widget": {"name": "hdr"}, "shape": 7, "name": "hdr", "label": "hdr", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "hdr"}, {"widget": {"name": "global_tone"}, "shape": 7, "name": "global_tone", "label": "global_tone", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "global_tone"}, {"widget": {"name": "detail"}, "shape": 7, "name": "detail", "label": "detail", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "detail"}, {"widget": {"name": "color"}, "shape": 7, "name": "color", "label": "color", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "color"}, {"widget": {"name": "runtime_dir"}, "shape": 7, "name": "runtime_dir", "label": "runtime_dir", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "runtime_dir"}, {"widget": {"name": "wine_prefix"}, "shape": 7, "name": "wine_prefix", "label": "wine_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "wine_prefix"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "RH_DLSS5Enhance", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#43d978", "size": [323.2095642089844, 578], "pos": [5923.85986328125, -894.54296875], "id": 192, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_DLSS5Enhance"}, "order": 23}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [333, 345], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "color": "#57ed8c", "widgets_values": [2, 50, "fixed", "wavelet", 512, 32, 1024, 32], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 317, "label": "model", "type": "VOSR2_MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "image", "link": 343, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscale"}, "name": "upscale", "link": 347, "label": "upscale", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "upscale"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "color_alignment"}, "name": "color_alignment", "label": "color_alignment", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "color_alignment"}, {"widget": {"name": "tile_size"}, "name": "tile_size", "label": "tile_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "tile_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "tile_overlap"}, "name": "tile_overlap", "label": "tile_overlap", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "tile_overlap"}, {"widget": {"name": "vae_tile_size"}, "name": "vae_tile_size", "label": "vae_tile_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "vae_tile_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "vae_tile_overlap"}, "name": "vae_tile_overlap", "label": "vae_tile_overlap", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "vae_tile_overlap"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "type": "VOSR2Upscale", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#43d978", "size": [270, 280], "pos": [5260.6640625, -881.3406372070312], "id": 27, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-vosr2", "ver": "1a46fd5e78e5f2de5e6a4525f04374301ce9b09d", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "ylchen333/ComfyUI-VOSR2", "Node name for S&R": "VOSR2Upscale"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [340.7731628417969, 67.25700378417969], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [3952.499755859375, -1099.9044189453125], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 207, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#e94899", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 34, "backgroundAlpha": 1, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "阶段1——素材资产", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#ffffff"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [388.2854919433594, 65.94084167480469], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [6016.88623046875, -1099.9044189453125], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 209, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#3dd975", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 34, "backgroundAlpha": 1, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "阶段3——DLSS5放大", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#fcfcfc"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [388.2854919433594, 65.94084167480469], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [4988.2119140625, -1099.9044189453125], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 208, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#3dd975", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 34, "backgroundAlpha": 1, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "阶段2——vosr2.0放大", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#fcfcfc"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [1571.433349609375, 96.07421875], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [4589.40771484375, -1358.2164306640625], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 210, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#8439ac", "borderRadius": 39, "textAlign": "center", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 82, "backgroundAlpha": 0.6, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "VOSR 2.0+DLSS5视频超分-拆解系列07集", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#E3E3E3"}, "order": 19}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "KKvideo_latentpreview": false, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreview": false, "node_versions": {"ComfyUI-VOSR2": "d7eeecc09e26cf9c9b0a87b1dc511830e45e4eb1", "comfy-core": "0.34.0"}, "ds": {"offset": [-2984.320244181671, 1697.3752709857736], "scale": 0.3380916604057101}, "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "KKvideo_latentpreviewrate": 0, "pixaromaGroups": [], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0"}, "groups": [{"color": "#00ccf5", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "vosr2.0", "bounding": [4440, -990, 1430.93310546875, 1149.093994140625]}, {"color": "#f736a6", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "资产", "bounding": [3961.13037109375, -992.0736083984375, 386.89666748046875, 755.9302978515625]}, {"color": "#00ccf5", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "dlss5", "bounding": [5906.62451171875, -986.4197998046875, 713.227294921875, 1146.8309326171875]}], "links": [[317, 26, 0, 27, 0, "VOSR2_MODEL"], [321, 150, 2, 152, 1, "AUDIO"], [333, 27, 0, 161, 0, "IMAGE"], [334, 150, 2, 161, 1, "AUDIO"], [342, 150, 0, 166, 0, "IMAGE"], [343, 166, 0, 27, 1, "IMAGE"], [344, 169, 0, 166, 2, "FLOAT"], [345, 27, 0, 192, 0, "IMAGE"], [346, 192, 0, 152, 0, "IMAGE"], [347, 163, 0, 27, 2, "INT"]], "id": "d0d30e15-23bf-476c-bb7c-545d44d051d4", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 210, "revision": 0}